WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.362
Sid looked at Sara's hat.

2
00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:13.977
"Maybe I can knock it down."

3
00:00:13.978 --> 00:00:19.387
Sid held up a rock.

4
00:00:19.388 --> 00:00:21.903
He swung his tail.

5
00:00:21.904 --> 00:00:25.247
Whap!

6
00:00:25.248 --> 00:00:28.342
The rock flew over the tree!

7
00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:35.564
Sid shrugged. "Oops!"

8
00:00:35.565 --> 00:00:38.025
Sara picked up a rock.

9
00:00:38.026 --> 00:00:40.383
"I'll try."

10
00:00:40.384 --> 00:00:46.002
Sara swung her arm.

11
00:00:46.003 --> 00:00:49.407
The rock hit the hat!

12
00:00:49.408 --> 00:00:52.431
The hat landed on Sid.

13
00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:58.829
Everyone laughed.

14
00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:04.292
"Let's make hats now," Rex said.

15
00:01:04.293 --> 00:01:07.878
Everyone walked toward the bridge.

16
00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:11.594
"You all helped me," Sara said.

17
00:01:11.595 --> 00:01:17.626
"Now I want to help Nate."

18
00:01:17.627 --> 00:01:20.394
Sara looked around.

19
00:01:20.395 --> 00:01:25.073
"Nate! Where are you?"

20
00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:35.496
Nate hopped over. "Here I am."

21
00:01:35.497 --> 00:01:39.386
"You can have my hat," Sara said.

22
00:01:39.387 --> 00:01:41.584
Nate shook his head.

23
00:01:41.585 --> 00:01:45.990
"No, thank you," he said.

24
00:01:45.991 --> 00:01:50.471
"I have a better house now."

25
00:01:50.472 --> 00:01:53.504
"Where?" Sara asked.

26
00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:56.085
Nate pointed to the bridge.

27
00:01:56.086 --> 00:02:09.051
"Under there!"

